strings.value:
{R"And so do the crowds!"}
Suddenly you hear screams everywhere!
{R"Blood! Blood! BLOOD!"}

The voice booms:
{R"Not bad mortal! For the weakling that you are, you show some determination."}
You hear screams everywhere!
{R"More Blood! More BLOOD!"}

The voice continues:
{R"I can now let you go free, or you may try to complete the challenge!
Do you want to continue the fight?"}

The voice booms:
{R"Impressive mortal! Your determination to survive makes me excited!"}
You hear screams everywhere!
{R"More Blood! More BLOOD!"}

The voice continues:
{R"I can let you go now, and give you a small reward, or you can choose to fight the final challenge!
Do you want to continue the fight?"}

The voice booms:
{R"Congratulations mortal! A pity you came to destroy us, for you would make a formidable Hell warrior!"}
You hear screams everywhere!
{R"Champion! Blood! Champion! More BLOOD!"}
The voice continues:
{R"I grant you the title of Hell's Arena Champion!
And a promise is a promise... Search the arena again!"}

